CostProof Licensing

Copyright (c) 2026 StreamKernel LLC.

CostProof uses the same component-level licensing model as CostProof across the
StreamKernel Proof Suite. The intent is simple: the developer-facing proxy and SDKs are
Apache-licensed, while the dashboard/server product layer is source-available under the
Business Source License 1.1.

1. Licensing Structure

----------------------

costproof-proxy (Python) - Apache License 2.0

Includes the core proxy, routing engine, OpenAI/Anthropic/Ollama adapters, local
configuration, cost estimation, budget enforcement, SQLite audit storage, and CLI.

Covered paths include:

- src/costproof/__init__.py
- src/costproof/adapters/
- src/costproof/cli/
- src/costproof/config/
- src/costproof/proxy/
- src/costproof/router/
- src/costproof/security/
- src/costproof/storage/
- examples/
- docs/
- tests/

costproof-server - Business Source License 1.1

Includes the dashboard server, team API, per-project attribution, alerting, policy engine,
management API, and metrics/export surfaces.

Covered paths include:

- src/costproof/server/

costproof-sdk (Python/TypeScript) - Apache License 2.0

Includes programmatic spend querying and management API clients.

Covered paths include:

- src/costproof/sdk/
- packages/typescript-sdk/

