Additional Use Grant:

You may use costproof-server for local self-hosted dashboard use, development, testing,
evaluation, and unlimited local requests with costproof-proxy. This Additional Use Grant
does not include offering costproof-server as a hosted or managed service, cloud dashboard
sync service, team policy service, alerting service, SSO-enabled service, or other
commercial service to third parties without a commercial license from StreamKernel LLC.

1. Pricing Tiers

----------------

Free (Open Source Core) - Proxy, routing engine, OpenAI/Anthropic/Ollama adapters, CLI,
local dashboard, unlimited requests. No credit card required. The proxy and SDK components
are Apache 2.0; the local dashboard is included under the BSL 1.1 Additional Use Grant
above.

Individual - $19/month - Adds cloud dashboard sync, 90-day history, email alerts, circuit
breaker notifications, and priority support.

Team - $179/month, up to 10 seats - Adds per-project attribution, team spend policies,
Slack alerts, GitHub Actions cost gate, and SSO.

Enterprise - Custom - Adds BYO key management, air-gapped deployment, SLA,
Datadog/Prometheus export, and dedicated onboarding.

